====== ASUS DSL-N12U ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

The device is ADSL wireless N router with 
  * 2 not-detachable antenna
  * 4 Port 100/10 Switch
  * 1 Port ADSL Wan Interface
  * 1 Port USB for printer sharing
  * 16 MB Flash
  * 32 MB SDRAM

===== Hardware =====
==== Info ====
^ Architecture     | MIPS                 |
^ Vendor           | Asus                 |
^ Bootloader       | U-Boot               |
^ System-On-Chip   | RT3052F              |
^ CPU Speed        | 320 MHz              |
^ Flash-Chip       | M25P128              |
^ Flash size       | 16 MiB               |
^ RAM              | 32 MiB               |
^ RAM-Chip         | W9825G6EH            |
^ Wireless         | RT2860?              |
^ Ethernet         | Switch in CPU        |
^ ADSL             | TC3086 + TC3162LEM   |
^ USB              | 1x2.0                |
^ Serial           | [[#Serial|Yes]]      |
^ JTAG             | N/A                  |

